# Input for requirements.txt, which pins every package with hashes.
# Resolve it with the Python version the dependencies job runs (3.12): some
# of pip-audit's dependencies are conditional on it, and a lock resolved
# under 3.14 left out typing_extensions, which 3.12 needs. None depend on
# the platform, so a Linux resolve installs on the Windows runner. Regenerate
# with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --no-emit-index-url --strip-extras requirements.in
pip-audit==2.10.1
